# 行尾与文本属性统一（此前缺失，导致工作区被编辑器改成 CRLF 后
# `git status` 恒显示 20 个文件"全量修改"，真实改动被噪声淹没）。
#
# 约定：仓库内一律 LF；Windows 批处理保留 CRLF（cmd.exe 对 LF 的
# goto/label 解析有历史坑）。二进制文件禁止行尾转换。

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，也不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.pyc binary
*.pdf binary
